WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.900
Curtain is designed around shielded notes
for stocks and USDG.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.100
Zero-knowledge proofs verify a spend
without revealing private details.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.500
RelayAdapt combines unshielding,
a swap or vault action, and reshielding.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:17.700
One transaction.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.300
If one step fails, everything reverts.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.100
View keys reveal a chosen account or note.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.700
The origin-only exit returns assets
to the depositing wallet.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.850
Curtain. Privacy, by design.
